               <text>
                  <paragraph>anhydrous citric acid,edetate disodium,  FD and C Blue #1, FD and C Red # 40, flavors, glycerin, propylene glycol, propyl gallate, purified water,  sodium benzoate, sorbitol, sucralose, xanthan gum</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20130401"/>
            </section>
         </component>
